  "about": {
    "title": "About the Plasma Freeze set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: Plasma Freeze is a Black & White expansion released on 8 May 2013. It has 122 cards: 116 in the main set and 6 secret rares. There are also 100 reverse holos.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 116 main set cards), the <b>Master set</b> (216 cards, adding the reverse holos) or the <b>Grand Master set</b> (all 222 cards, adding the 6 secret rares).",
      "This free checklist lets you tick off the cards you own, count spare copies for trading, see your progress by rarity and plan your binder pages. It works on phones and computers, even offline, and your collection stays on your device."
    ]
